flowchart TB
    accTitle: Reasoning and optional retrieval in proposal
    accDescr: Current working information supports reasoning that generates candidate actions. Retrieval may optionally bring relevant long-term information into working memory as additional context.

    WM[Current working information] --> REASON[Reasoning with the LLM]
    LTM[Relevant long-term memory] -. optional .-> RET[Retrieval]
    RET -. adds information .-> WM
    REASON --> CAND[One or more action candidates]
    CAND --> LATER[Later consideration outside this chapter]

    classDef store fill:#EEF7EE,stroke:#27AE60,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.5px;
    classDef process fill:#EAF4FB,stroke:#1A4A8A,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.5px;
    classDef context fill:#F4F4F4,stroke:#888888,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.2px;
    class WM,LTM store;
    class RET,REASON process;
    class CAND,LATER context;
